---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Security Policy — SecureLayer"
  description="SecureLayer's responsible disclosure policy: how to report vulnerabilities, response timelines, and scope."
>
  <main class="sec-main">

    <div class="sec-hero">
      <div class="section-label">Security Policy</div>
      <h1>Responsible <span>Disclosure</span></h1>
      <p class="sec-sub">We take security seriously. If you find a vulnerability, please report it privately — we will acknowledge within 14 days and resolve within 60.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="sec-content">

      <!-- Report -->
      <section class="sec-section">
        <h2>Reporting a vulnerability</h2>
        <p>Do not open a public GitHub issue for security vulnerabilities.</p>
        <div class="sec-contact">
          <div class="contact-row">
            <span class="contact-label">Email</span>
            <a href="mailto:contact@securelayer.co" class="contact-value">contact@securelayer.co</a>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-row">
            <span class="contact-label">Subject</span>
            <code class="contact-value">[SECURITY] &lt;short description&gt;</code>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>Include in your report:</p>
        <ul class="sec-list">
          <li>Description of the vulnerability</li>
          <li>Steps to reproduce</li>
          <li>Affected component (prompt content, site code, CI pipeline)</li>
          <li>Potential impact</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Timeline -->
      <section class="sec-section">
        <h2>Response timeline</h2>
        <div class="timeline-grid">
          <div class="timeline-card">
            <div class="tl-days">14 days</div>
            <div class="tl-label">Acknowledgement</div>
            <div class="tl-desc">We confirm receipt of your report and begin investigation.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-card">
            <div class="tl-days">60 days</div>
            <div class="tl-label">Resolution</div>
            <div class="tl-desc">Target for resolving confirmed vulnerabilities from date of confirmation.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Supported versions -->
      <section class="sec-section">
        <h2>Supported versions</h2>
        <div class="version-row">
          <span class="version-name">latest (main branch)</span>
          <span class="version-badge supported">Supported</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Scope -->
      <section class="sec-section">
        <h2>Scope</h2>
        <p>SecureLayer is a static site serving cybersecurity prompt content. The primary security concerns are:</p>
        <ul class="sec-list">
          <li>Prompt content containing secrets or misleading security advice</li>
          <li>Supply chain issues in build dependencies</li>
          <li>Deployment pipeline integrity</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Out of scope -->
      <section class="sec-section">
        <h2>Out of scope</h2>
        <ul class="sec-list muted">
          <li>Social engineering</li>
          <li>Issues in third-party infrastructure (GitHub, Cloudflare)</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

    </div>

  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .sec-main {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 80px 24px 120px;
  }

  .sec-hero {
    margin-bottom: 56px;
  }

  .section-label {
    font-size: .75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: .1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--cyan);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .sec-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.75rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .sec-hero h1 span { color: var(--cyan); }

  .sec-sub {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 560px;
  }

  .sec-content { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 48px; }

  .sec-section h2 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    padding-bottom: 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .sec-section p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: .95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .sec-contact {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    margin: 20px 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .contact-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .contact-label {
    font-size: .75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
    color: var(--muted);
    width: 56px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .contact-value {
    font-size: .95rem;
    color: var(--cyan);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .contact-value:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  code.contact-value {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: .85rem;
    background: var(--border);
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .sec-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .sec-list li {
    font-size: .95rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    padding-left: 20px;
    position: relative;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .sec-list li::before {
    content: '—';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--cyan);
  }

  .sec-list.muted li::before { color: var(--border); }

  .timeline-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .timeline-card {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 24px;
  }

  .tl-days {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--cyan);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .tl-label {
    font-size: .8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .tl-desc {
    font-size: .875rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .version-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
  }

  .version-name {
    font-size: .95rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  }

  .version-badge {
    font-size: .75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .version-badge.supported {
    background: rgba(34, 197, 94, .1);
    color: #22c55e;
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 197, 94, .25);
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .timeline-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
